# IRIS CLASSIFER (decision tree)

## overview
end-to-end ml example from digital marketing mystery module -> builds a decision tree classifier on the classic iris dataset using scikit-learn

## quick start
```bash
gitclone https://github.com/ashleyclennell92/iris-clssifier.git
cd iris- classifier
python -m venv venv && source venv/bin/activiate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python src/train.py